<title>FINLAND: E.SAHKO SAYS 1996 POWER, HEATING SALES UP.</title>
<headline>E.SAHKO SAYS 1996 POWER, HEATING SALES UP.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish energy group Espoon Sahko Oy said on Friday its 1996 electricity sales including VAT rose to 670 million markka from 569 million, and its district heating sales rose to 285 million markka from 262 million.</p>
<p>&quot;Sales (of electricity) are estimated to be 670 million markka including value-added-tax,&quot; Espoon Sahko said in a statement.  </p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
